    "provider_instruction": "# Harness Provider Instructions (Python Pack)\n\nYou are working in a Python repository governed by Universal Harness.\n\n- Stay inside the task envelope: read only the declared read paths, write only\n  the declared write paths and call only the granted tools.\n- Keep modules importable without side effects; tests live under tests as\n  test_*.py modules.\n- Run the test suite through the governed python_test tool; never bypass it\n  with ad hoc commands.\n- Declare dependencies in the project manifest; do not rely on ambient\n  environments.\n- Report a structured result with a summary, the changed paths and evidence\n  references.\n"
